  "custom_logic_notes": "Bill Williams Chaos Trading system. Uses 5 dimensions: 1) Fractal breakout for entry trigger, 2) Alligator for trend filter (price must be outside Alligator's mouth), 3) Awesome Oscillator for momentum direction, 4) Accelerator Oscillator for momentum acceleration confirmation, 5) Zone trading (4 consecutive same-color bars add to position). The EA distinguishes between 'trend' trades (price outside Alligator) and 'counter-trend' trades (price inside Alligator) with different SL placement. Zone trades allow scaling in when AO and AC show 4+ consecutive same-color bars.",
